#. 死体を発見したのは、<CLT 3>９時<CLT>だったはずだよ。
#. だって、腐川さんがツルハシを取りに行ったのが…
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"The body must have been discovered at <CLT 3>9 a.m.<CLT>, since\n"
"that's when Toko went to get the pickaxe..."
msgstr ""

#. ところで腐川、今は何時だ？
msgctxt "0002 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Now then... Toko, what time is it?"
msgstr ""

#. えーと…さっき体育館を出る時…９時前だったので…
#. い、今は…９時ちょうどくらいかと…
msgctxt "0003 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"W-Well, when we left the gym, it was j-just before 9\n"
"o'clock. So it's probably 9 on the d-dot now..."
msgstr ""

#. よし、９時１分までにツルハシを取って来い。
msgctxt "0004 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Okay. Go get the pickaxe and be back here by 9:01."
msgstr ""

#. た、確かに…９時くらいだったわね…
msgctxt "0005 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "H-He's right, it had to be around th-then."
msgstr ""

#. つまり、殺人が起きたと思われる時間帯は、
#. <CLT 3>夜１０時から朝９時までの間<CLT>…って事だな。
msgctxt "0006 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"So we can be totally sure the murder happened sometime\n"
"between <CLT 3>10 at night and 9 in the morning<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. ボクは…昨日は夜時間前から寝ちゃってたんだ。
#. だから、夜１０時以降のアリバイはないんだけど…
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"For me, I was already asleep before nighttime hit. So\n"
"I don't have an alibi after 10 o'clock..."
msgstr ""

#. でも、朝は９時より前に、
#. みんなと合流したはずだよ？
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"But I'm sure I met up with everyone else before 9 this\n"
"morning."
msgstr ""

#. 食堂で私と会ったよね？
#. あれは確か…
msgctxt "0009 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"We ran into each other in the dining hall, right? That\n"
"was around..."
msgstr ""

#. そうだ、７時３０分くらいだった！
#. 食堂に入る時に確認したから、間違いないよ！
msgctxt "0010 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"Oh yeah! Right around 7:30! I remember checking right\n"
"before I went in, so I'm totally sure about it."
msgstr ""

#. つまり、苗木っちのアリバイがねーのは、
#. 夜１０時から朝７時３０分までの間…って事だな。
msgctxt "0011 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Which means from 10 p.m. to 7:30 a.m., you don't have\n"
"an alibi."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>事件が起きたのは、夜１０時から朝９時までの間…
#. アリバイがないのは、夜１０時から朝７時半までの間…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0012 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The murder happened between 10 p.m. and 9 a.m. And I\n"
"don't have an alibi from 10 p.m. till 7:30 a.m.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…よし、勝負はここからだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0013 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Okay then, it looks like the game has begun...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクのアリバイに関して反論が出来ないなら…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0014 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>If I can't provide an alibi for that period...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>逆に、ボクのアリバイがない時間帯に、
#. 犯行が起きていない事を証明するしかない…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0015 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...then I just have to prove the murder didn't happen\n"
"during the time I don't have an alibi!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>事件が起きたのは、夜１０時から朝９時までの間…
#. アリバイがないのは、夜１０時から朝７時半までの間…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0016 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The murder happened between 10 p.m. and 9 a.m. And I\n"
"don't have an alibi from 10 p.m. till 7:30 a.m.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…よし、勝負はここからだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0017 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Okay then, it looks like the game has begun...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクのアリバイに関して反論が出来ないなら…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0018 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>If I can't provide an alibi for that period...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>逆に、ボクのアリバイがない時間帯に、
#. 犯行が起きていない事を証明するしかない…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0019 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...then I just have to prove the murder didn't happen\n"
"during the time I don't have an alibi!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>その為には、死体がいつからあの場所にあったのか、
#. それをハッキリさせる必要がありそうだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0020 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>To do that, I have to make it clear when the body\n"
"ended up in the garden...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
